  "content": [
    {
      "text": "thine eyes are upon the haughty, 2 Sam. 22:28. my heart is not haughty, nor mine eyes lofty, Ps. 131:1. an haughty spirit before a fall, Prov. 16:18. Before destruction the heart of man is haughty, Prov. 18:12. haughtiness of men shall be made low, Isa. 2:17 (2 Ne. 12:17). daughters of Zion are haughty, Isa. 3:16 (2 Ne. 13:16). haughty shall be humbled, Isa. 10:33 (2 Ne. 20:33). lay low the haughtiness of the terrible, Isa. 13:11 (2 Ne. 23:11). thou shalt no more be haughty because of my holy mountain, Zeph. 3:11.",
